# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Reviewer-facing repository policy
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Keep the public/reviewer repository limited to artifacts needed to reproduce
# and inspect the ICML Pro-Action paper:
# - paper source/PDF, ICML style files, bibliography
# - calibration, smoke tests, axiom/math checks
# - benchmark code, prompts, checkpoints, cited results
# - generated figure(s) actually used in the submitted paper
#
# Internal notes, old venue formats, drafts, reviews, exploratory analyses, and
# unused figures are ignored.

# Python / environments / caches
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
venv/
ENV/
env/
.venv/

